#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:9
msgid "What I do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:11
msgid ""
"Analyze the knowledge base (`.hero/knowledge/`) for patterns that should "
"be promoted to conventions, decisions, or warnings. This turns raw "
"captured notes into structured team intelligence."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:15
msgid "When to use me"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:17
msgid "At the end of a sprint or after 5+ knowledge entries have been captured"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:18
msgid "When `/prime` detects a growing knowledge base (>10 entries)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:19
msgid "When the user asks \"what have we learned?\" or \"any patterns?\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:21
msgid "How to use me"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:23
msgid "Read all entries in `.hero/knowledge/notes/`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:24
msgid "Group by topic (file paths mentioned, error types, technologies)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:25
msgid "Identify patterns:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:26
msgid "**Repeated decisions**: same choice made 3+ times → suggest a convention"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:27
msgid "**Recurring issues**: same debugging finding 2+ times → suggest a rule"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:28
msgid ""
"**Converging practices**: similar approaches across specs → suggest "
"codifying"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:29
msgid "For each pattern found, suggest an action:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:30
msgid "`/convention` to codify a repeated practice"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:31
msgid "Add to an existing convention if one covers the topic"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:32
msgid "Flag as a potential architectural concern if it's a structural pattern"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:34
msgid "Output format"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:36
msgid ""
"Knowledge flywheel — N entries analyzed\n"
"\n"
"Patterns detected:\n"
"\n"
"  1. Convention candidate: \"Error handling in API routes\"\n"
"     Seen in: 3 notes (auth-debugging, payment-retry, export-errors)\n"
"     Suggestion: /convention codify API error response retry pattern\n"
"\n"
"  2. Recurring issue: \"Database connection pool exhaustion\"\n"
"     Seen in: 2 notes (monday-outage, load-test-findings)\n"
"     Suggestion: Add connection pool monitoring to operational runbook\n"
"\n"
"  3. No new patterns (N entries too unique to cluster)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:52
msgid "What not to do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:54
msgid "Don't fabricate patterns — only surface what's genuinely repeated"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:55
msgid "Don't suggest conventions for one-off decisions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:56
msgid "Don't modify existing knowledge entries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/knowledge-flywheel/SKILL.md:57
msgid "Don't require an LLM — pattern detection is keyword/topic clustering"
msgstr ""

